## Expected Impact

| Scenario | Current | With Damage Tracking |
|----------|---------|---------------------|
| Idle (cursor blink) | 2 full renders/sec | **2 line-only renders** (~95% reduction) |
| Typing | 1 full render/keystroke | 1 partial (editor area) |
| Status update | 1 full render | 1 partial (status bar only) |

**Estimated improvement:**
- Cursor blink: **80-95% fewer pixels** (1-2 lines vs entire window)
- Typing: **20-50% fewer pixels** (editor area vs full window)
- Status changes: **90%+ fewer pixels** (status bar is ~3% of window)

---

## Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Stale pixels | Conservative damage; Full for any uncertainty |
| Modal dim accumulation | Always Full when modal active |
| Cursor line miscalculation | Track both previous + current lines |
| Selection spans lines | Fall back to EditorArea for selection |
| Regression | `damage-debug` feature to visualize |

