# Fix: ExtendSelectionToPosition crashes with multiple cursors

## Bug Summary
When shift-clicking with multiple cursors active, the app panics with "index out of bounds: the len is 1 but the index is 4".

## Root Cause
In `src/update/editor.rs:457-460`, `ExtendSelectionToPosition` truncates cursors to 1 but doesn't reset `active_cursor_index`:

```rust
if editor.cursors.len() > 1 {
    editor.cursors.truncate(1);
    editor.selections.truncate(1);
    // BUG: active_cursor_index not reset!
}
