## Implementation Details

### 1. Add FrameData struct (node.rs)

Add after `TextData` struct (~line 57):

```rust
/// Frame data for containers with explicit dimensions.
/// Unlike Group, Frame has fixed width/height independent of children.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]
pub struct FrameData {
    /// Explicit width in local units
    pub width: f32,

    /// Explicit height in local units
    pub height: f32,

    /// Clip children to frame bounds
    pub clip_content: bool,

    /// Optional background (rendered behind children)
    pub background: Option<Paint>,
}

impl Default for FrameData {
    fn default() -> Self {
        Self {
            width: 100.0,
            height: 100.0,
            clip_content: false,
            background: None,
        }
    }
}

impl FrameData {
    /// Create a new frame with given dimensions.
    pub fn new(width: f32, height: f32) -> Self {
        Self {
            width,
            height,
            clip_content: false,
            background: None,
        }
    }

    /// Create a frame with background.
    pub fn with_background(width: f32, height: f32, background: Paint) -> Self {
        Self {
            width,
            height,
            clip_content: false,
            background: Some(background),
        }
    }
}
```

### 2. Add Frame variant to NodeKind (node.rs)

Update enum at line 17-26:

