    /// Container node with ordered children
    Group,

    /// Frame: container with explicit dimensions (like Figma frames/artboards)
    Frame(FrameData),

    /// Vector path (lines, curves, shapes)
    Shape(PathData),

    /// Text content (placeholder for future implementation)
    Text(TextData),
}
```

### 3. Add import for Paint (node.rs)

At top of file, add:
