# Unified Jakefile.register() API for JS Syntax Highlighters

## Goal
Add a consistent `Jakefile.register(instance)` helper to each separate package (highlightjs-jake, prism-jake, shiki-jake) so users get the same ergonomic API regardless of which library they use.

## Design Decisions
- **Keep separate packages** - highlightjs-jake, prism-jake, shiki-jake remain independent
- **Per-library CDN files** - keep prism-jake.min.js, highlightjs-jake.min.js, shiki-jake.tmLanguage.json
- **Unified helper** - each package exports `Jakefile` object with `.register()` method

## Unified API

### highlight.js
```js
// Browser
<script src="highlight.min.js"></script>
<script src="highlightjs-jake.min.js"></script>
<script>Jakefile.register(hljs);</script>

// ESM
import hljs from 'highlight.js/lib/core';
import { Jakefile } from 'highlightjs-jake';
Jakefile.register(hljs);
```

### Prism.js
```js
// Browser
<script src="prism.min.js"></script>
<script src="prism-jake.min.js"></script>
<script>Jakefile.register(Prism);</script>

// ESM
import Prism from 'prismjs';
import { Jakefile } from 'prism-jake';
Jakefile.register(Prism);
```

### Shiki
```js
// Shiki is async - provide grammar instead of register
import { createHighlighter } from 'shiki';
import { Jakefile } from 'shiki-jake';

const highlighter = await createHighlighter({
  themes: ['github-dark'],
  langs: [Jakefile.grammar]
});

// Or with register helper (wraps loadLanguage)
await Jakefile.register(highlighter);
```

## Implementation

### 1. editors/highlightjs-jake/src/languages/jake.js
```js
function hljsDefineJake(hljs) {
  // ... existing definition ...
}

const Jakefile = {
  definition: hljsDefineJake,
  register(hljs) {
    hljs.registerLanguage('jake', hljsDefineJake);
    hljs.registerLanguage('jakefile', hljsDefineJake);
    return this;
  }
};

// CommonJS + Browser globals
if (typeof module !== 'undefined' && module.exports) {
  module.exports = hljsDefineJake;
  module.exports.Jakefile = Jakefile;
  module.exports.default = hljsDefineJake;
} else if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {
  window.hljsDefineJake = hljsDefineJake;
  window.Jakefile = Jakefile;
}
```

### 2. editors/prism-jake/index.js
```js
const jakeGrammar = {
  // ... existing grammar ...
};

const Jakefile = {
  grammar: jakeGrammar,
  register(Prism) {
    Prism.languages.jake = jakeGrammar;
    Prism.languages.jakefile = jakeGrammar;
    return this;
  }
};

// Auto-register if Prism is global (backwards compat)
if (typeof Prism !== 'undefined') {
  Jakefile.register(Prism);
}

// Exports
if (typeof module !== 'undefined' && module.exports) {
  module.exports = jakeGrammar;
  module.exports.Jakefile = Jakefile;
  module.exports.default = jakeGrammar;
} else if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {
  window.Jakefile = Jakefile;
}
```

### 3. editors/shiki-jake/index.js
```js
import grammar from './jake.tmLanguage.json' with { type: 'json' };

const Jakefile = {
  grammar: {
    name: 'jake',
    scopeName: 'source.jake',
    aliases: ['jakefile'],
    ...grammar
  },

  // Async register helper for consistency
  async register(highlighter) {
    await highlighter.loadLanguage(this.grammar);
    return this;
  }
};

export { Jakefile };
export default Jakefile.grammar;
```

## Files to Modify

1. **editors/highlightjs-jake/src/languages/jake.js**
   - Add `Jakefile` object with `register()` method
   - Export both `hljsDefineJake` (backwards compat) and `Jakefile`
   - Remove the old `window.Jakefile` convenience helper (lines 159-172)

2. **editors/prism-jake/index.js**
   - Extract grammar to named const
   - Add `Jakefile` object with `register()` method
   - Keep auto-register for backwards compat
   - Export both grammar and `Jakefile`

3. **editors/shiki-jake/index.js**
   - Convert to ESM
