5. **site/src/content/docs/guides/js-syntax-highlighters.mdx**
   - Update installation examples to show unified API

6. **editors/*/README.md**
   - Update documentation with new API

## Backwards Compatibility
- `hljsDefineJake` global still works (highlight.js)
- Auto-register behavior still works for Prism (if Prism global exists)
- Old import patterns still work
- New `Jakefile.register()` is additive

