|----------------|---------------|---------------|----------|
| 0 | 0 | 0-7 | total - 8 |
| 5 | 0 | 0-7 | total - 8 |
| 8 | 1 | 1-8 | total - 9 |
| 12 | 5 | 5-12 | total - 13 |

