### Expected Behavior After Fix

**During Editing:**
- Column width = `max(edited_cell_length, current_column_width)`
- Column can GROW to fit new content (up to 32 chars)
- Column NEVER shrinks (prevents truncation bug)
- Horizontal scrolling activates when content > 32 chars

**On Confirm (Enter):**
- Column width kept as-is (already correctly sized)
- Edited content synced to document

**On Cancel (Escape):**
- Column width restored to pre-edit width
- Edited content discarded

